2:T585,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Wren kitchen price include fitting?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"This depends on Wren's current quotation and the package you select. Check whether kitchen supply and installation are listed separately, and ask for an itemised scope of work."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What extra costs can come with Wren kitchen installation?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Possible additional costs can include removal and disposal, plumbing or electrical alterations, flooring, tiling, plastering, decorating, worktop changes and repairs identified after the old kitchen is removed. Confirm exclusions in writing."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is it cheaper to use an independent kitchen fitter than Wren?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"There is no universal saving. An independent fitter may be useful where you need flexible work or several renovation trades, but compare like-for-like written quotes and confirm exactly what each includes."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can I compare a Wren fitting quote with another quote?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Request an itemised breakdown covering labour, materials, removal, appliances, services, finishing work, waste and VAT. Make sure both quotations cover the same kitchen components and preparation work."}}]}7:["slug","kitchen-fitting-cost-wren","d"]
